This directory vendors source (not prebuilt binaries) from:

- platform/packages/apps/Launcher3
  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/apps/Launcher3
- platform/frameworks/libs/systemui (iconloaderlib, plus unused
  animationlib / motiontoollib / viewcapturelib kept for tag provenance)
  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/libs/systemui

AOSP tag: android-14.0.0_r28
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory and
in launcher3/ and systemui/)

Hermes compiles Launcher3 without Quickstep via
examples/android/launcher3/build.gradle.kts and iconloaderlib via
examples/android/iconloader/build.gradle.kts. The AOSP Gradle files
under this tree are not part of the Hermes build graph.

Hermes user-app shims (not upstream) are listed in README.md.
